(
    title: "Forest",
    description: Some("A poor woodcutter sets out to fell trees for his family, but a witch has turned the forest\'s animals against him, sending them at him along the ground while a bird drops stones from above. He hacks the creatures down with his ax or leaps over them — the snake can only be jumped, never killed — and every third screen he must chop through a tree, four blows to a side, before the run begins again a little faster."),
